```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Ana Bileşenler
    Client[İstemci Uygulaması] --> API[FastAPI]
    API --> Routes[API Rotaları]
    Routes --> Services[Servisler]
    Services --> Models[Modeller]
    Services --> DB[MongoDB]
    
    %% API Rotalar Detay
    Routes --> AuthRoutes[Auth Routes]
    Routes --> ContentRoutes[İçerik Routes]
    Routes --> CollectionRoutes[Koleksiyon Routes]
    Routes --> CommentRoutes[Yorum Routes]
    Routes --> UserContentRoutes[Kullanıcı-İçerik Routes]
    
    %% Servisler Detay
    Services --> AuthService[Auth Service]
    Services --> ContentService[İçerik Service]
    Services --> CollectionService[Koleksiyon Service]
    Services --> CommentService[Yorum Service]
    Services --> UserContentService[Kullanıcı-İçerik Service]
    
    %% Modeller Detay
    Models --> UserModel[Kullanıcı Model]
    Models --> ContentModel[İçerik Model]
    Models --> CollectionModel[Koleksiyon Model]
    Models --> CommentModel[Yorum Model]
    Models --> UserContentModel[Kullanıcı-İçerik Model]
    
    %% Diğer Bileşenler
    API --> Middleware[CORS Middleware]
    API --> Config[Konfigürasyon]
``` 